#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:5
msgid "Insert table"
msgstr "插入表格"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectorTech 0.7 does not have any `tool`_ or `menu`_ item which creates "
"tables with the number of rows and columns desired automatically. "
"QElectroTech allows importing HTML text, this is the way to create tables."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 0.7 没有任何可自动创建所需行列数表格的 `工具 <tool_>`_ 或 `菜单 <menu_>`_ "
"项。QElectroTech 允许导入 HTML 文本，这就是创建表格的方法。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:11
msgid "Select icon **Add textfield** |textfield| from the `toolbar`_."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择 **添加文本字段** 图标 |textfield| 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:51
msgid "textfield"
msgstr "文本字段图标"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:12
msgid ""
"Click on the area from the `workspace`_ where the table should be created."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中要创建表格的区域单击。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:13
msgid "Right click on text field and choose **Edit the text field** option."
msgstr "右键单击文本字段，并选择 **编辑文本字段** 选项。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech text field option"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本字段选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:20
msgid "Choose the **source** tab from the `text field editor`_."
msgstr "在 `文本字段编辑器 <text field editor_>`_ 中选择 **源** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:25
msgid "Figure: Source tab text field editor"
msgstr "图：文本字段编辑器的源标签页"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:27
msgid "Copy the ``html`` code generated by the HTML Table Generator."
msgstr "复制 HTML 表格生成器生成的 ``html`` 代码。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:28
msgid "Choose the **Rich Text** tab from the `text field editor`_."
msgstr "在 `文本字段编辑器 <text field editor_>`_ 中选择 **富文本** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:33
msgid "Figure: Rich text tab text field editor"
msgstr "图：文本字段编辑器的富文本标签页"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:35
msgid "Fill the headers and cells with the corresponding information."
msgstr "用相应信息填写表头和单元格。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:36
msgid "Press **OK** button and the table will be created at the `workspace`_."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮，表格将在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中创建。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:40
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Add**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > 添加** 将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:42
msgid ""
"The table can be `moved`_ and `rotated`_ over the folio area like a `text "
"field`_, it is a `text field`_ object."
msgstr ""
"表格可以像 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 一样在图幅区域中 `移动 <moved_>`_ 和 `旋转 <rotated_>`_ "
"，它本身就是一个 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:46
msgid ""
"Many different HTML Table Generator can be found on interned or can be "
"installed at the computer, an online option is:"
msgstr "可以在互联网上找到许多不同的 HTML 表格生成器，也可以将其安装到计算机上，一个在线选项是："

#: ../../source/users/schema/table.rst:49
msgid "https://www.quackit.com/html/html_table_generator.cfm"
msgstr "https://www.quackit.com/html/html_table_generator.cfm"
